"``pfam_accession`` (string) (required) Pfam family accession. Examples: "
"'PF00001' (7tm\\_1, GPCR rhodopsin family), 'PF00076' (RRM\\_1, RNA "
"recognition motif), 'PF00069' (Pkinase), 'PF00096' (zf-C2H2, zinc "
"finger)."
msgstr ""

